              "type": "listItem",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "text": "If the rulebook says you can't write stuff down, and instead need to keep things to memory, but the AI keeps things to memory by writing information into its memory bank, that is allowed.",
